# Talk to Akara (monstats 148, specs/world/npc.md §4 trade row), open her
# store, buy the first store item, sell the character's cap.
# Gold is stat 14 (npc.md §9). Store items and the cap are found by GUID
# order (`@4`); BuyItem / SellItem cost fields: what the client sends
# is not specified yet, 0 here.
scenario 1
name vendor-buy-sell
game 1.14d
seed 0x00001234
map 644409375        # the test character's map ID (specs/sim/rng.md §5.4)
difficulty normal
expansion yes
end 200

char class 1
char area 0 1
char at default
char stat 14 5000
char item cap inv 0 0

record s2c rng units stats
snapshot every 25

at 2 msg RunToUnit type=1 id=@1:148
at 60 msg InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:148
at 70 msg InitEntityChat id=@1:148
at 80 msg EntityAction action=1 npc=@1:148 item=0
at 100 msg BuyItem npc=@1:148 item=@4#1 mode=0 cost=0
at 130 msg SellItem npc=@1:148 item=@4 tab=0 cost=0
at 160 msg TerminateEntityChat id=@1:148
